# Lessons Learned Workflow

- Before planning or implementation, read `LESSONS_LEARNED.md`.
- When a roadblock occurs, add a concise entry with:
  - the roadblock,
  - the solution used,
  - one prevention note.
- Keep entries brief and actionable (short bullet style).
- Add newest entries at the top of the entries section.
